{"ref":"BDB, מַעֲנֶה²","hw":"מַעֲנֶה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲנֶה</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.1\">Pr 15:1</a></sup> <strong>answer, response</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳־רַךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.1\">Pr 15:1</a> <em>a gentle answer;</em> cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲנֵה פִּיו</span> v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.23\">23</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, לָשׁוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_לָשׁוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לָשׁוֹן</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.1\">16:1</a> (i.e. ability to answer); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:7\" href=\"/Micah.3.7\">Mi 3:7</a> i.e. <em>response</em> for guidance; abs. also <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.19\">Pr 29:19</a> <em>response</em> = obedience; <a data-ref=\"Job 32:3\" href=\"/Job.32.3\">Jb 32:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:5\" href=\"/Job.32.5\">5</a> <em>reply</em>, refutation; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמַּעֲנֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.4\">Pr 16:4</a> = for its purpose, that for which it <em>answers</em> (v. Toy).","next":"BDB, מַ֫עַן²","prev":"BDB, יַעְנַי²"}